radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Geral \/ Internacional:<\/strong> \u00a359 a \u00a370<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (prazo limite de registo a 01\/09\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids & Fam\u00edlia<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Cardiff Half Junior \u2013 Family Fun Run (2,4 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 2 de Outubro de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 11:45<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Jovem \/ Geral (3+ anos):<\/strong> \u00a312<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (S\u00e1bado, 2 de Outubro de 2027)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Adulto Acompanhante (sem t-shirt\/medalha):<\/strong> \u00a33<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (m\u00e1ximo 2 adultos por crian\u00e7a)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Cardiff Half Junior \u2013 Future Challengers (1,6 km \/ 1 Milha)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 2 de Outubro de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 11:00<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">escal\u00f5es Sub-12, Sub-14, Sub-16 e Sub-18 (9\u201317 anos):<\/strong> \u00a312<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (partidas \u00e0s 11:00, 11:15 e 11:30)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Cardiff Half Junior \u2013 Toddler Dash (50 m)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 2 de Outubro de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:30<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Donativo Solid\u00e1rio NSPCC (at\u00e9 3 anos):<\/strong> \u00a32<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (inclui medalha de finalista)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a Meia Maratona de Cardiff 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova principal da Meia Maratona de Cardiff 2027 realiza-se no domingo, 3 de outubro de 2027, com partida em Castle Street (junto ao Castelo de Cardiff) e meta no Civic Centre (King Edward VII Avenue, junto ao City Hall), na capital do Pa\u00eds de Gales, Reino Unido. No s\u00e1bado, 2 de outubro de 2027, disputam-se as provas jovens e familiares da Cardiff Half Junior no Civic Centre.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida das diferentes provas e vagas?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">No domingo, 3 de outubro de 2027, a corrida de cadeiras de rodas parte \u00e0s 09:57. A Meia Maratona (21,097 km) arranca \u00e0s 10:00 para as vagas White, Green, Red e Pink, e \u00e0s 10:10 para as vagas Blue, Purple e Yellow. No s\u00e1bado, 2 de outubro de 2027, as provas da Cardiff Half Junior partem \u00e0s 10:30 (Toddler Dash 50 m), 11:00 (Rapazes Sub-12\/14 \u2013 1,6 km), 11:15 (Raparigas Sub-12\/14 \u2013 1,6 km), 11:30 (Sub-16\/18 Misto \u2013 1,6 km) e 11:45 (Family Fun Run \u2013 2,4 km).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funcionam as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es e os pre\u00e7os para atletas internacionais em 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Devido \u00e0 elevada procura do circuito SuperHalfs, a entrada geral funciona por sorteio (Ballot), com inscri\u00e7\u00e3o gratuita at\u00e9 18 de outubro de 2026 e an\u00fancio de resultados a 22 de outubro de 2026. Caso seja sorteado, o valor do International Ballot \u00e9 de \u00a370 (e \u00a359 no UK Ballot, ou \u00a354 para filiados Welsh Athletics), acrescido de taxa de administra\u00e7\u00e3o. A partir de 22 de outubro de 2026 abrem tamb\u00e9m as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es diretas via SuperVouchers SuperHalfs, operadores tur\u00edsticos oficiais (incluindo ag\u00eancia oficial para Portugal e Espanha) e institui\u00e7\u00f5es solid\u00e1rias, como a parceira principal NSPCC (\u00a340 de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o com compromisso de angaria\u00e7\u00e3o de \u00a3300). O prazo limite global de registo encerra a 1 de setembro de 2027.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando \u00e9 feito o levantamento do dorsal para corredores residentes em Portugal?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os dorsais de atletas residentes fora do Reino Unido n\u00e3o s\u00e3o enviados por via postal. Todos os participantes internacionais devem levantar o seu kit de corrida (dorsal com chip e guia oficial) presencialmente na Event Village, situada nos relvados do Cardiff City Hall Lawns, na sexta-feira (1 de outubro, das 12:00 \u00e0s 18:00), no s\u00e1bado (2 de outubro, das 08:00 \u00e0s 17:00) ou no pr\u00f3prio domingo da corrida a partir das 07:00.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite de prova e que ritmos de pacers est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tempo limite oficial de corte (cut-off) para concluir os 21,097 km \u00e9 de 4 horas (4h00m), exigindo a passagem na milha 6 at\u00e9 \u00e0s 12:15 e na milha 10 at\u00e9 \u00e0s 13:15. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza marcadores de ritmo (pacers) oficiais para os tempos alvo de 1h30, 1h40, 1h50, 2h00, 2h10, 2h20, 2h30, 2h45 e 3h00.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A Meia Maratona de Cardiff 2027 pontua para o passaporte SuperHalfs?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim. A Meia Maratona de Cardiff \u00e9 uma das 6 provas fundadoras e oficiais do circuito europeu SuperHalfs, juntamente com Lisboa, Praga, Berlim, Copenhaga e Val\u00eancia. Basta inserir o n\u00famero do SuperPassport no formul\u00e1rio de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o para receber o carimbo digital oficial ap\u00f3s cruzar a meta no Civic Centre.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Meia Maratona de Cardiff 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-10-03\", \"endDate\": \"2027-10-03\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Cardiff, Reino Unido\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Reino Unido\", \"addressRegion\": \"Reino Unido\", \"addressCountry\": \"GB\"}}, \"description\": \"A Meia Maratona de Cardiff 2027 realiza-se a 3 de outubro no Pa\u00eds de Gales. Corrida de 21,1 km do circuito SuperHalfs. Consulta o percurso e inscri\u00e7\u00f5es aqui!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-meia-maratona-de-cardiff.webp\"], \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.cardiffhalfmarathon.co.uk\/take-part\/register\/\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza a Meia Maratona de Cardiff 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova principal da Meia Maratona de Cardiff 2027 realiza-se no domingo, 3 de outubro de 2027, com par